# LAB 3 – IoT Smart Gate Control with Blynk, IR Sensor, Servo Motor, and TM1637


- **Course:** Internet of Things (IoT)
- **Lab:** Lab 3 – Smart Gate Control System

---

## Project Overview

This project demonstrates an IoT Smart Gate Control System using an ESP32 microcontroller, Blynk cloud platform, IR obstacle sensor, servo motor, and TM1637 4-digit display.

The system can:

- Detect objects using an IR sensor
- Automatically open and close a gate using a servo motor
- Count object detection events
- Display the count on a TM1637 display
- Send data to Blynk for remote monitoring
- Support automatic and manual control modes

---

